aim:OSD-BME-V1.5 a mkg:AIM ;
    mkg:acronym "OSD-BME-V1.5" ;
    mkg:apiProfile "Basic" ;
    mkg:description "Basic Multimodal Scene Editing: Basic Scenes and Basic Objects of at least two media - Audio, Visual, Speech, LiDAR, 3D Model, RADAR, Ultrasound, Offline Map - composed into a Basic Multimodal Scene (a voice over music is a BMS of a BAS and a BSS, or of a BAO and a BSO). It is Multimodal Scene Editing (OSD-MSE) working on the Basic Scenes and Basic Objects: each of its two Scene Ports takes a Basic Scene of any medium, each of its two Object Ports a Basic Object of any medium, and the User Command (with the User PoV, optional) places, moves, changes and removes them in the one open Basic Multimodal Scene; the User Command with its response leaves on the second output." ;
    mkg:ofStandard standard:OSD ;
    mkg:port <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/OSD-BME-V1.5/port/Input/CAE-UCM-V1.0/0>,
