datatype:MMM-UCM-V2.2 a mkg:DataType ;
    mkg:acronym "MMM-UCM-V2.2" ;
    mkg:description "DRAFT, not published. What a participant asks the Secretary of a meeting (a request, UserCommandRQ) and what the Secretary answers (a response, UserCommandRS) under the same UserCommandID. Exactly one of the two is present, as in the User Command (CAE-UCM). The Secretary is a User (a Process) that speaks with the User of a participant; its Voice Command Interface turns what the participant says into the request." ;
    mkg:ofStandard standard:MMM ;
    mkg:schema <https://schemas.mpai.community/MMM4/V2.2/data/UserCommand.json> ;
    mkg:sourceAI true ;
    mkg:title "User Command V2.2" .

