        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/CAE-BAS-V2.5/flow/6>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/CAE-BAS-V2.5/flow/7>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/CAE-BAS-V2.5/flow/8>,
