        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/NNW-NTI-V2.0/port/Input/NNW-DST-V2.0/3>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/NNW-NTI-V2.0/port/Input/NNW-DST-V2.0/4>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/NNW-NTI-V2.0/port/Input/NNW-PLD-V2.0/0>,
        <https://mpai.community/kg/aim/NNW-NTI-V2.0/port/Output/NNW-INF-V2.0/1>,
