    mkg:acronym "PGM-MIH-V1.0" ;
    mkg:apiProfile "Basic" ;
    mkg:description "The Multimodal Input Harmonisation (PGM-MIH) AI Module assembles the audio, visual, textual, and paralinguistic evidence available about a scene into a single Harmonised Multimodal Context, in which each item of evidence is placed on a common time base and attributed to the User that produced it, by" ;
